{"id":"n59176-1-7","stage":5,"title":"보태다 · 补贴","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59176-1-7-1","ko":"방학 동안 아르바이트를 해서 번 돈은 어디다 쓸 계획이니?","zh":"假期打工赚的钱，你打算用来做什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방학","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}},{"text":"동안","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}},{"text":"아르바이트를","meaning":"打工","explanation":"아르바이트：打工；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아르바이트","audio":"/audio/fe901ac998302ac9cf89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24506","senseId":"1","lemma":"아르바이트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아르바이트를","audio":"/audio/667c90c1b5f931e15d48.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"번","meaning":"赚，挣","explanation":"벌다：赚，挣；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"벌다","audio":"/audio/0c2e9654aebad7fa3ddc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59096","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}},{"text":"돈은","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈은","audio":"/audio/efd79924e71a2c4ed877.mp3"}},{"text":"어디다","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；다：表示放置的位置或在原有内容上添加；与前面的格助词或 데 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디다","audio":"/audio/13876b89fd442a8185f1.mp3"}},{"text":"쓸","meaning":"花，费，花费","explanation":"쓰다：花，费，花费；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"5","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓸","audio":"/audio/fe874efc41706f784970.mp3"}},{"text":"계획이니?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획이니","audio":"/audio/29a580029554dc6cbce9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3","entryId":"20207","definition":"学校里一个学期结束后在一定期间内停止课业；或那个期间。","pronunciation":["방ː학"]},{"id":"2aa02e1d6b86b37d","term":"동안","zh":"期间","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3","entryId":"70749","definition":"从某一时期另一时期之间的时间长度。","pronunciation":["동안"]},{"id":"fe901ac998302ac9","term":"아르바이트","zh":"打工","audio":"/audio/fe901ac998302ac9cf89.mp3","entryId":"24506","definition":"为赚钱而在自己的主业以外临时做的事。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"0c2e9654aebad7fa","term":"벌다","zh":"赚，挣","audio":"/audio/0c2e9654aebad7fa3ddc.mp3","entryId":"59096","definition":"通过工作获得或攒下钱财。","pronunciation":["벌ː다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","